:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Copyright Quartz Systems 2026.
:HELP NAME=CHGGRPA.Change Group Attributes (CHGGRPA)
:P.Use the Change Group Attributes (CHGGRPA) command to make the job a
group job, rename it, or leave the group.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGGRPA/GRPJOB'.Group job (GRPJOB)
:P.The group job.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGGRPA/GRPJOBTXT'.Group job text (GRPJOBTXT)
:P.The group job text for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*BLANK:EPK.
:PD.Blanks&colon. no value.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 50 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGGRPA/MSGQ'.Message queue (MSGQ)
:P.The message queue that receives the messages the command or the
object sends.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.No message queue&colon. messages are not sent.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPWSUSR.Display Work Station User (DSPWSUSR)
:P.The Display Work Station User (DSPWSUSR) command works with the
display station and the jobs signed on at it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPWSUSR/OUTPUT'.Output (OUTPUT)
:P.Where the command sends what it produces&colon. to the display of an
interactive job, or to a spooled file of the job's printer file. Some
commands can also write it to a database file.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*:EPK.
:PD.The output is shown at the display of an interactive job, and
printed for a batch job.
:PT.:PK.*PRINT:EPK.
:PD.The output is printed with the job's spooled output.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=ENDGRPJOB.End Group Job (ENDGRPJOB)
:P.Use the End Group Job (ENDGRPJOB) command to end a job of the group,
or this one.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ENDGRPJOB/GRPJOB'.Group job (GRPJOB)
:P.The group job.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ENDGRPJOB/RSPGRPJOB'.Group job to be resumed (RSPGRPJOB)
:P.The group job to be resumed for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*PRV:EPK.
:PD.The previous release.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ENDGRPJOB/LOG'.Job log (LOG)
:P.The job log for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NOLIST:EPK.
:PD.No list.
:PT.:PK.*LIST:EPK.
:PD.A list is shown.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=SETATNPGM.Set Attention Program (SETATNPGM)
:P.Use the Set Attention Program (SETATNPGM) command to set the program
the Attention key runs for the job.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SETATNPGM/PGM'.Program (PGM)
:P.The program the command calls or works on, by name and library.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*CURRENT:EPK.
:PD.The current one.
:PT.:PK.*PRV:EPK.
:PD.The previous release.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='SETATNPGM/SET'.Set attention key (SET)
:P.The set attention key for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*ON:EPK.
:PD.On.
:PT.:PK.*OFF:EPK.
:PD.Off.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=TFRGRPJOB.Transfer to Group Job (TFRGRPJOB)
:P.Use the Transfer to Group Job (TFRGRPJOB) command to move the display
to another job of the group, starting it when the group has none of that
name.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='TFRGRPJOB/GRPJOB'.Group job (GRPJOB)
:P.The group job.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*PRV:EPK.
:PD.The previous release.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *SELECT.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='TFRGRPJOB/INLGRPPGM'.Initial group program (INLGRPPGM)
:P.The initial group program for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=TFRSECJOB.Transfer Secondary Job (TFRSECJOB)
:P.Use the Transfer Secondary Job (TFRSECJOB) command to move the
display to the secondary job, signing one on when there is none.
:P.The command has no parameters.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
